{"unit_id":"cpt-kenvie__EmotionPet#feature-status","repo":"cpt-kenvie/EmotionPet","commit":"c8406a069040ada3d347b44e5db0a263de58ee27","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Emotion Pet 的功能「状态表情」：它读取会话运行、增量回复、工具调用、待审批和错误状态，并显示接收、思考、检索、等待、完成或错误表情。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/pet-state.ts:148-181"]}
{"unit_id":"cpt-kenvie__EmotionPet#feature-interact","repo":"cpt-kenvie/EmotionPet","commit":"c8406a069040ada3d347b44e5db0a263de58ee27","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Emotion Pet 的功能「宠物互动」：点击宠物可摸摸，右键菜单可投喂、玩耍或休息；闲置一段时间后会逐步发呆、疲惫并休眠。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/EmotionPetDock.tsx:443-506"]}
{"unit_id":"cpt-kenvie__EmotionPet#feature-follow","repo":"cpt-kenvie/EmotionPet","commit":"c8406a069040ada3d347b44e5db0a263de58ee27","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Emotion Pet 的功能「随对话停靠」：打开“随对话”后，任务运行期间宠物缩小并显示在可见的对话状态内容行；任务停止或状态行隐藏时会回到输入区。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/EmotionPetDock.tsx:233-258","src/client/EmotionPetDock.tsx:586-599"]}
{"unit_id":"cpt-kenvie__EmotionPet#feature-appearance","repo":"cpt-kenvie/EmotionPet","commit":"c8406a069040ada3d347b44e5db0a263de58ee27","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Emotion Pet 的功能「外观自定义」：在互动菜单中可选择圆润、三角或宝石形状，切换预设或自定义颜色，并设置特殊表情是否沿用原色；选择保存在当前浏览器。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/EmotionPetDock.tsx:514-529","src/client/EmotionPetDock.tsx:657-704"]}
{"unit_id":"cpt-kenvie__EmotionPet#caveat-local-storage","repo":"cpt-kenvie/EmotionPet","commit":"c8406a069040ada3d347b44e5db0a263de58ee27","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Emotion Pet 会把宠物形状、颜色、表情颜色跟随状态和停靠位置写入当前浏览器的 localStorage；Web 与 Desktop 页面分别保存这些偏好。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/EmotionPetDock.tsx:34-38","src/client/EmotionPetDock.tsx:125-132"]}
